  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Beyond.Runtime::Beyond.Interaction.JournalNote
  title: Recovered Transmission
  body: '[AUTO-PRINT  -  BUFFERED TRANSMISSION  -  RECEIVED 3 DAYS AGO]


    ...CONTROL, THIS IS MERIDIAN CAMP. HALE WAS RIGHT. THE SIGNAL IS NOT TERRESTRIAL. IT IS COMING FROM THE MOON. SOUTH POLE REGION. IT REPEATS EVERY 27 MINUTES.


    THE OLD SITE K-7 FACILITY HAS THE ONLY DISH BIG ENOUGH TO ANSWER. ILVES FOUND THE ACCESS CODES IN THE ARCHIVE. WE ARE GOING IN.


    BUNKER ENTRANCE IS BEHIND THE NORTH RIDGE.


    IF WE DO NOT CHECK IN WITHIN 48 HOURS... SEND NO ONE.


    [END OF BUFFER]'
